      "content": "fair enough. but even without seeing the raw files, u should be able to look at the consensus. most independent analysts and fact-checkers have already pointed out the massive contradictions in what they said vs the actual data. if the majority of credible experts are saying the testimony was a lie, isn't it more accurate to say it was misleading rather than just saying 'i can't say'?",
